Package: BGFanalyzeR
Type: Package
Title: An R Package to Analyze Microbial Biogas Fermentation Data
Version: 0.9.6
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Maximilian", "Strick",
      email = "maximilianb.strick@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: The package allows to work with biogas fermentation data in R.
    Although the focus is set on bigas fermentations, concepts and workflows may be also applicable to other fermentations where not a gaseous product is measured.
    The package introduces a new S3 object class, the BGF, and provides methodes to build an manipulate these objects.
    It furthermore provides functions that bridge to established plot engines for data visualisation.
